  "$comment": "Lock file for the v64 engine binaries. The six core files (v86.wasm, v86-fallback.wasm, v86-parallel.wasm, libv86.mjs, cpu-worker.js, vcpu-worker.js) are NOT the upstream bytes served by `url`: they are the upstream 74d2bafc build with `scripts/patches/v64-ioapic-irq0-gsi2.patch` applied, rebuilt in a clean tree (glbridge/vx_naga.wasm is re-emitted by the same build). Their `url` stays the upstream provenance for the same path, so `prepare-v64-assets.mjs` fails loudly instead of silently installing an unpatched binary. Every other asset is byte-identical to upstream.",
